# StenoDesk Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# 1. WWW -> apex (canonical domain) — 301 permanent
https://www.stenodesk.co/* https://stenodesk.co/:splat 301!

# 2. SPA fallback: known client routes serve the SPA (spa.html = build copy of
#    index.html; proxying to /index.html directly triggers CF's automatic
#    /index.html -> / 308 canonicalization). Per-route rules only — NOT a
#    blanket /* rewrite — so genuinely unknown paths fall through to 404.html.
/login /spa 200
/login/ /spa 200
/signup /spa 200
/signup/ /spa 200
/forgot-password /spa 200
/forgot-password/ /spa 200
/reset-password /spa 200
/reset-password/ /spa 200
/app/* /spa 200
/portal/* /spa 200

# 3. DEBUG: isolate path-rule vs full-URL-rule behavior (remove after test)
/test-301-xyz / 301
https://www.stenodesk.co/testwww-abc / 301
